,["$","li","Businesses seeking working capital facilities against receivables from a bank",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Businesses seeking working capital facilities against receivables from a bank"}]]}],["$","li","Manufacturers at Pandesara, Sachin or Hazira supplying larger corporate customers",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Manufacturers at Pandesara, Sachin or Hazira supplying larger corporate customers"}]]}],["$","li","Founders who genuinely intend to raise outside investment and issue shares",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Founders who genuinely intend to raise outside investment and issue shares"}]]}]]}]]}]}]}]
2f:["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary","children":"Local considerations"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] lg:leading-tight","children":"What is worth checking in Surat"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"These are the points that actually differ by market, rather than the general features of the structure."}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-border md:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","li","Moving from a family firm means changing the habits too",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Moving from a family firm means changing the habits too"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"For a Surat firm that has run on a partnership deed and informal records, the company itself is the easy part. The harder part is that a company requires statutory audit from its first financial year, proper books, board minutes, and a clear line between the owners' money and the company's. Drawing from the company is a formal act, through salary, dividend or board-approved fees, not a withdrawal from the till."}]]}],["$","li","Consider the LLP as the intermediate step",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Consider the LLP as the intermediate step"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Where the concern is personal liability rather than raising equity, converting a Surat partnership firm to an LLP caps liability while keeping the partner structure and profit shares recognisable, at a fraction of a company's annual cost. Going straight to a company because it sounds more serious is a common and expensive mistake. Ask what the company is actually buying you."}]]}],["$","li","Two directors and a defensible registered office",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Two directors and a defensible registered office"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"A Private Limited Company needs at least two directors and two shareholders, with one director resident in India for 182 days or more in the previous calendar year. The registered office needs a recent utility bill and a no-objection certificate from the owner. For businesses operating out of shared market premises around Ring Road or the diamond belt, the address documentation is the step that most often causes a query."}]]}],["$","li","Export registrations are separate from incorporation",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"04"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Export registrations are separate from incorporation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Incorporating does not give you an Importer Exporter Code, and it does not by itself satisfy a buyer's compliance checks. IEC and any trade-specific registration are separate applications that follow incorporation. We say which apply to your line of business rather than implying incorporation covers everything."}]]}]]}]]}]}]
